  "description": "Saint Mary's has been building an excellent reputation since its founding in 1802. Today it is a nationally-recognized institution with a wide range of highly-regarded programs. Our students are known for leaving Saint Mary's ready for the academic and professional challenges that await them. Saint Mary's has consistently ranked in the top-5 primarily undergraduate universities in the country according to the 2024 Maclean's University Rankings. We're currently ranked number three and top-ranked for student awards and second place for scholarships and bursaries. About 98% of our full-time professors have their Ph.D., which is more than any other university in the province. These accomplished professors bring their depth of experience to the classroom.",
